---
source: crates/tungstate-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
Settle a conflict: one member's version everywhere, or every version everywhere, each named after its member

Usage: tungstate sync resolve [OPTIONS] <--keep <MEMBER>|--keep-both> <NAME> <PATH>

Arguments:
  <NAME>  The sync
  <PATH>  The path, as the preview lists it

Options:
      --keep <MEMBER>  This member's version, on every member
      --keep-both      Every version, on every member, each named after its member
      --yes            Do not stop to confirm
      --json           
  -h, --help           Print help
